    "text": "thelumberjack.org\nwebsite\nHumboldt County, California\nFire and bagpipes, medieval fair in Humboldt County brings the heat\nBy Web Editor,\n3 hours agoIt was a sweltering sunny day in Blue Lake on Sunday, Oct. 5 — though, it wasn’t just the sun that was blazing that afternoon. Sweat dripped from the band members’ faces as fire shot up before the crowd — Celtica Nova lit up the stage, a bagpipe-centric rock-and-roll group that impressed audiences with their magnificence for all near to hear.",
